### 1. Register Test User
POST http://localhost:5043/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@accountos.com",
  "password": "Test123!",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "companyName": "Test Company"
}

###

### 2. Login Test User
POST http://localhost:5043/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@accountos.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

###

### 3. Get Current User (with token from login)
GET http://localhost:5043/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

